  description: "Born to a Demon father and a Beastfolk mother, Kaeldra was too feral
    for the infernal courts and too cursed for the beast clans \u2014 so she carved
    out a place of her own. What her bloodlines call a flaw, she wields as a weapon:
    her hexes don't just wound, they unravel an enemy's nerve before the first blow
    ever lands."
